{
  "uid": "v2-replication",
  "title": "v2 · Replication — per-tenant F1/F2/F3",
  "tags": ["packiot-v2", "replication", "flip"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Tenant",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total, tenant)", "refId": "A" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Are Incoplast & CPACK replicating across all three flows?\nThe engine writes each tenant's data to **F1** `public` (legacy compute), **F2** `shadow_go_port` (Go, same DB), and **F3** `packiot_shadow` (refactored). For a mirrored tenant the three cumulative write-counts should track **exactly**. `simcorp` / `staging` only reach F1 (out of shadow scope) — that is expected, not a gap."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Cumulative writes by tenant × flow (F1 = F2 = F3 for mirrored tenants)",
      "description": "oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total, summed. A mirrored tenant's three cells match exactly; simcorp/staging show only f1_public.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" } }, "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant, dest) (oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\", result=\"ok\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "labelsToFields", "options": { "mode": "columns", "keepLabels": ["tenant", "dest"] } },
        { "id": "groupingToMatrix", "options": { "columnField": "dest", "rowField": "tenant", "valueField": "Value" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "F1 → F3 write drift per tenant (must be 0)",
      "description": "sum(f1_public) − sum(f3_packiot_shadow) per tenant. Non-zero on a mirrored tenant = a replication gap; the truthful cause for simcorp/staging is 'no F3 by design' (they show their full F1 count here and are not mirrored).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name", "orientation": "auto" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\", dest=\"f1_public\", result=\"ok\"}) - sum by (tenant) (oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\", dest=\"f3_packiot_shadow\", result=\"ok\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Write rate by tenant × flow (rows/s)",
      "description": "rate(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total[5m]). The three flows for a mirrored tenant move together.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "wps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant, dest) (rate(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\", result=\"ok\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant}} · {{dest}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "edge-transformer triple-emit rate by flow (should be 1:1:1)",
      "description": "rate(edge_transformer_emitted_total[5m]) — the fan-out that feeds all three flows. The three lines overlap when healthy.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 6, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (flow) (rate(edge_transformer_emitted_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{flow}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Write ERRORS by tenant × flow (healthy = flat 0)",
      "description": "rate(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{result=\"error\"}[5m]). A flat zero line is correct — this panel is a truthful-empty when the pipeline is clean.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "wps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto" }, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant, dest) (rate(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\", result=\"error\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant}} · {{dest}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
